    "body": "IIRC this was a problem I actually had when working on FirefoxOS (in the context of transferring photos between apps on a low-end mobile device): there was no way to tell when the transfer failed because of memory allocation failure. I don't have a strong opinion on how it is signaled, but I would have liked to have some kind of error signal two or three years ago.",
