    "created_at": "2017-03-09T08:21:21Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-03-09T08:21:21Z",
    "body": "You don't need to copy ArrayBuffer when transfering within a process (agent cluster). And if you transfer with MessageChannel and eventually end up in a different process a copy can be done late.\r\n\r\n(I was going to make an argument that we should consider not exposing the process boundaries, but SharedArrayBuffer already does that, so we might as well expose it for ArrayBuffer too.)",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
