    "created_at": "2017-04-10T11:15:57Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-04-10T11:15:57Z",
    "body": "While working on this in #2518 I realized that if we want to do this properly we should do away with StructuredCloneWithTransfer so we can distinctly notify the sender (for serialization) and receiver (for deserialization) errors. The tight coupling would present a different API otherwise. This impacts `window.postMessage()`. Does everyone agree with that?",
